    "name": "Sub Terra",
    "steam_appid": 3696090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/0fb62ee3393b80ec10ea5ebf6e3e3f18.avif?t=1755243002\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.poster.avif?t=1755243002\" width=482 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.webm?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.mp4?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Sub Terra</strong></u> is a single-player first person psychological horror game inspired by The Backrooms. As a maintenance worker, you've spent your whole life venturing deep underground to repair pipes, gas lines, you name it. Utilities that we take for granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a day like any other, you enter the manhole and descend the depths to replace a water line at the end of tunnel <i><strong>04-R</strong></i>. The job is straightforward. The directions are clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your repair doesn't go quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/c9945aa2dee1be1cdb9765d0d3e69416.avif?t=1755243002\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.poster.avif?t=1755243002\" width=482 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.webm?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.mp4?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and spatialized audio create a truly immersive experience guaranteed to make you feel like you're really 50 feet under.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Mystery: </strong>Piece together hints and clues to learn the tragic story of what's been buried underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep an Eye Out: </strong>You know the tunnels like the back of your hand, but you're not the only thing down there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locations: </strong>Your job may be down a manhole, but you'll discover <strong>much more</strong> than just maintenance tunnels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: <u><strong>Sub Terra</strong></u> contains loud noises, flashing lights and material that may be disturbing to some individuals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/0fb62ee3393b80ec10ea5ebf6e3e3f18.avif?t=1755243002\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.poster.avif?t=1755243002\" width=482 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.webm?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/976ef069185845b91e7299cd4c98818f.mp4?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Sub Terra</strong></u> is a single-player first person psychological horror game inspired by The Backrooms. As a maintenance worker, you've spent your whole life venturing deep underground to repair pipes, gas lines, you name it. Utilities that we take for granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a day like any other, you enter the manhole and descend the depths to replace a water line at the end of tunnel <i><strong>04-R</strong></i>. The job is straightforward. The directions are clear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your repair doesn't go quite as planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/c9945aa2dee1be1cdb9765d0d3e69416.avif?t=1755243002\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.poster.avif?t=1755243002\" width=482 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.webm?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696090/extras/1070ec32462b092748e1905e3e891f49.mp4?t=1755243002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Realistic graphics and spatialized audio create a truly immersive experience guaranteed to make you feel like you're really 50 feet under.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Mystery: </strong>Piece together hints and clues to learn the tragic story of what's been buried underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep an Eye Out: </strong>You know the tunnels like the back of your hand, but you're not the only thing down there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locations: </strong>Your job may be down a manhole, but you'll discover <strong>much more</strong> than just maintenance tunnels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: <u><strong>Sub Terra</strong></u> contains loud noises, flashing lights and material that may be disturbing to some individuals.</p>",
